# Skill Routing

Carregue a skill lendo o arquivo indicado **antes** de implementar:

| Cenário | Arquivo |
|---------|---------|
| Endpoint, controller, Fluent, auth | `skills/server-side-swift/AGENTS.md` ou `SKILL.md` |
| Padrões deste repo | `skills/server-side-swift/ml-backoffice-patterns.md` |
| Docker, CI, GitHub Actions, deploy | `skills/swift-server-ci/AGENTS.md` ou `SKILL.md` |
| App iOS/macOS, TestFlight | `skills/xcode-cloud/AGENTS.md` ou `SKILL.md` |
| Routing, middleware Vapor | `skills/server-side-swift/vapor-patterns.md` |
| Fluent queries, relations | `skills/server-side-swift/database-patterns.md` |

**Este repo é SPM puro** — CI/deploy → `swift-server-ci`, **não** `xcode-cloud`.

Skills em `.cursor/skills/` e `.claude/skills/` (cópias de `skills/`). Ver `AGENTS.md` na raiz.
